<title>驱动组{{NEW}}项目Bringup报告</title><callout background-color="rgb(240,244,255)" border-color="rgb(130,167,252)" emoji="💡"><p><b>Skill Phase3 导出</b></p><p><b>填色</b>：单元格 <span background-color="rgba(255,246,122,0.8)">浅黄 = Skill/Agent 自动填</span>；<span background-color="rgb(251,191,188)">橙色 = 人工填</span>。表头灰底仅作列名。禁止编造；导出后不得残留 <code>{{…}}</code>。</p></callout><h1 seq="auto" seq-marker="1.">表格建立时间点</h1><p>建议 Pre-T0（T0 板子回来前一周）由驱动侧 PL 建立本报告。</p><table><colgroup><col width="225"/><col width="352"/></colgroup><thead><tr><th background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>项</p></th><th background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>内容</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>驱动侧 PL</p></td><td background-color="rgb(255,200,140)" vertical-align="top"><p>待填</p></td></tr><tr><td background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>Skill 导出日期</p></td><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>{{DATE}}</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h1 seq="auto" seq-marker="2.">硬件变更确认（PL，硬件基带开发人员）</h1><p>本节确认「相对基础项目改了什么、材料齐不齐」。器件/GPIO 的<b>代码落地与签字</b>在第 4 节。</p><p><b>参考项目名称（必须）</b><table><colgroup><col width="224"/><col width="328"/></colgroup><thead><tr><th background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>项</p></th><th background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>内容</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>平台</p></td><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>{{PLATFORM}}</p></td></tr><tr><td background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>基础项目 BASE</p></td><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>{{BASE}}</p></td></tr><tr><td background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>本项目 NEW</p></td><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>{{NEW}}</p></td></tr><tr><td background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>一句话说明</p></td><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>本项目基于 {{BASE}} 硬件变更而来</p></td></tr></tbody></table></p><p><b>关键器件变更</b><b>（必须）</b><p>硬件配置表：{{HW_DOC}}</p></p><p><b>GPIO 变更（必须）</b><p>GPIO 表链接：{{GPIO_DOC}}</p></p><p><b>软件项目计划</b><p>计划文档：【例 <cite doc-id="doccn5VzpCESv4Qe0DlTwoNa5md" file-type="doc" title="CSS（Cheetah/Swift/Swordfish）软件项目计划" type="doc"></cite>】</p></p><h1 seq="auto" seq-marker="3.">Codebase 的建立&amp;确认</h1><h2 seq="auto" seq-marker="3.1">建立项目开发环境（架构师）</h2><p>由 PL 提需求给架构师。下列三项均为人工确认；defconfig 文件清单可先看下一节自动表。</p><table><colgroup><col width="323"/><col width="328"/></colgroup><thead><tr><th background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>检查项</p></th><th background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>状态 / 说明</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>各固件 manifest 已建立</p></td><td background-color="rgb(255,200,140)" vertical-align="top"><p>待确认</p></td></tr><tr><td background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>各固件 defconfig 已建立</p></td><td background-color="rgb(255,200,140)" vertical-align="top"><p>待确认（对照下节自动列出的文件）</p></td></tr><tr><td background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>发布 CI 已对接且可出包</p></td><td background-color="rgb(255,200,140)" vertical-align="top"><p>待确认</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h2 seq="auto" seq-marker="3.2">检查代码分支和配置（PL）</h2><p>浅黄列由 Phase1/仓库填写（含 manifest xml 名称与 revision/分支字串）；备注列橙色。无对应固件时 defconfig 填「无」。远程 git 分支须架构师/CI 创建。</p><table><colgroup><col width="119"/><col width="215"/><col width="215"/><col width="120"/><col width="226"/><col width="226"/><col width="120"/><col width="80"/></colgroup><thead><tr><th background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" rowspan="2" vertical-align="top"><p>固件类型</p></th><th background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" colspan="3" vertical-align="top"><p>{{NEW}}（本项目）</p></th><th background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" colspan="3" vertical-align="top"><p>{{BASE}}（基础项目）</p></th><th background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" rowspan="2" vertical-align="top"><p>备注</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>xml（名称,分支）</p></td><td background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>defconfig</p></td><td background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>board</p></td><td background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>xml（名称,分支）</p></td><td background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>defconfig</p></td><td background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>board</p></td></tr><tr><td background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>jlinkbin</p></td><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>{{MF_JLINK_NEW}}</p></td><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>{{DC_JLINK_NEW}}</p></td><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>products/{{NEW}}</p></td><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>{{MF_JLINK_BASE}}</p></td><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>{{DC_JLINK_BASE}}</p></td><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>products/{{BASE}}</p></td><td background-color="rgb(255,200,140)" vertical-align="top"><p></p></td></tr><tr><td background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>bootloader</p></td><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>{{MF_BOOT_NEW}}</p></td><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>{{DC_BOOT_NEW}}</p></td><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>products/{{NEW}}</p></td><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>{{MF_BOOT_BASE}}</p></td><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>{{DC_BOOT_BASE}}</p></td><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>products/{{BASE}}</p></td><td background-color="rgb(255,200,140)" vertical-align="top"><p></p></td></tr><tr><td background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>recovery</p></td><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>{{MF_RECOVERY_NEW}}</p></td><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>{{DC_RECOVERY_NEW}}</p></td><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>products/{{NEW}}</p></td><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>{{MF_RECOVERY_BASE}}</p></td><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>{{DC_RECOVERY_BASE}}</p></td><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>products/{{BASE}}</p></td><td background-color="rgb(255,200,140)" vertical-align="top"><p></p></td></tr><tr><td background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>生产固件</p></td><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>{{MF_FCT_NEW}}</p></td><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>{{DC_FCT_NEW}}</p></td><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>products/{{NEW}}</p></td><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>{{MF_FCT_BASE}}</p></td><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>{{DC_FCT_BASE}}</p></td><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>products/{{BASE}}</p></td><td background-color="rgb(255,200,140)" vertical-align="top"><p></p></td></tr><tr><td background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>用户固件</p></td><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>{{MF_USER_NEW}}</p></td><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>{{DC_USER_NEW}}</p></td><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>products/{{NEW}}</p></td><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>{{MF_USER_BASE}}</p></td><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>{{DC_USER_BASE}}</p></td><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>products/{{BASE}}</p></td><td background-color="rgb(255,200,140)" vertical-align="top"><p></p></td></tr><tr><td background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>硬测固件</p></td><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>{{MF_HT_NEW}}</p></td><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>{{DC_HT_NEW}}</p></td><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>products/{{NEW}}</p></td><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>{{MF_HT_BASE}}</p></td><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>{{DC_HT_BASE}}</p></td><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>products/{{BASE}}</p></td><td background-color="rgb(255,200,140)" vertical-align="top"><p></p></td></tr><tr><td background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>sensorhub</p></td><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>{{MF_SH_NEW}}</p></td><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>{{DC_SH_NEW}}</p></td><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>products/{{NEW}}</p></td><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>{{MF_SH_BASE}}</p></td><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>{{DC_SH_BASE}}</p></td><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>products/{{BASE}}</p></td><td background-color="rgb(255,200,140)" vertical-align="top"><p></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p>board 完整路径前缀：<code>platform/board/{{PLATFORM}}/</code>。</p><table><colgroup><col width="454"/><col width="284"/></colgroup><thead><tr><th background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>Phase1 核对</p></th><th background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>结果</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>products/{{NEW}} 存在</p></td><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>{{P1_PRODUCTS_OK}}</p></td></tr><tr><td background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>主 defconfig 存在且板型 =y</p></td><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>{{P1_DEFCONFIG_OK}}</p></td></tr><tr><td background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>Config.in 含新板型与 CUSTOMIZE_DIR</p></td><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>{{P1_CONFIGIN_OK}}</p></td></tr><tr><td background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>仓库路径</p></td><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>{{REPO}}</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h2 seq="auto" seq-marker="3.3">检查项目的 defconfig（PL）</h2><p>对比 NEW 与 BASE 各固件实际生成的 <code>.config</code>，说明差异影响。Agent 不自动跑 menuconfig 时整表人工填。</p><p>例：<cite doc-id="CdTpwI664ia7iRkuoFBckm19nCg" file-type="wiki" title="XX项目-驱动领域config检查" type="doc"></cite> </p><table><colgroup><col width="120"/><col width="138"/><col width="120"/><col width="120"/></colgroup><thead><tr><th background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>固件类型</p></th><th background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>主要差异点</p></th><th background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>影响说明</p></th><th background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>结论</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td background-color="rgb(255,200,140)" vertical-align="top"><p>待填</p></td><td background-color="rgb(255,200,140)" vertical-align="top"><p>待填</p></td><td background-color="rgb(255,200,140)" vertical-align="top"><p>待填</p></td><td background-color="rgb(255,200,140)" vertical-align="top"><p>待填</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h2 seq="auto" seq-marker="3.4">检查项目宏的相关代码（PL）</h2><p>板型宏变化后，相关 <code>#if</code> / 挂接需已覆盖 NEW。</p><table><colgroup><col width="241"/><col width="328"/></colgroup><thead><tr><th background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>项</p></th><th background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>内容</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>板型宏</p></td><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>{{BASE_BOARD_SYM}} → {{NEW_BOARD_SYM}}</p></td></tr><tr><td background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>Phase1 挂接摘要</p></td><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>{{P1_HOOK_SUMMARY}}</p></td></tr></tbody></table><table><colgroup><col width="240"/><col width="240"/><col width="115"/><col width="115"/></colgroup><thead><tr><th background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>代码路径</p></th><th background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>修改说明</p></th><th background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>owner</p></th><th background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>确认结果</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>{{MACRO_PATH_1}}</p></td><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>{{MACRO_DESC_1}}</p></td><td background-color="rgb(255,200,140)" vertical-align="top"><p>待填</p></td><td background-color="rgb(255,200,140)" vertical-align="top"><p>待填</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h1 seq="auto" seq-marker="4.">硬件变更和确认（PL 和模块负责人）</h1><p>{{NEW}} 相对 {{BASE}} 的<b>落地与确认</b>。器件明细见第 2 节 Phase2 硬件配置表链接；本节对「需要改软件的项」写清影响、落点与签字。同型号且仅检查的项可一行摘要或省略。</p><h2 seq="auto" seq-marker="4.1">关键器件 / 硬件变更落地</h2><table><colgroup><col width="154"/><col width="154"/><col width="142"/><col width="130"/><col width="80"/><col width="177"/><col width="80"/><col width="80"/></colgroup><thead><tr><th background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>变更点</p></th><th background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>{{BASE}}</p></th><th background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>{{NEW}}</p></th><th background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>影响固件</p><p>(jlinkbin/boot/recovery/watch/FCT/HT)</p></th><th background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>影响功能</p></th><th background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>适配动作 / 代码落点</p></th><th background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>责任人</p></th><th background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>确认结果</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>{{CHG_NAME_1}}</p></td><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>{{CHG_BASE_1}}</p></td><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>{{CHG_NEW_1}}</p></td><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>{{CHG_FW_1}}</p></td><td background-color="rgb(255,200,140)" vertical-align="top"><p>待填（如功耗/存储…）</p></td><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>{{CHG_ACTION_1}}</p></td><td background-color="rgb(255,200,140)" vertical-align="top"><p>待填</p></td><td background-color="rgb(255,200,140)" vertical-align="top"><p>待填（完成/未完成）</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h2 seq="auto" seq-marker="4.2">GPIO 变更</h2><p>仅列出 BASE 信号 ≠ NEW 信号的脚。结果取值：已改 / 仅清单 / 待定。</p><table><colgroup><col width="154"/><col width="165"/><col width="154"/><col width="165"/><col width="189"/><col width="80"/><col width="165"/></colgroup><thead><tr><th background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>脚标识</p></th><th background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>{{BASE}} 信号</p></th><th background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>{{NEW}} 信号</p></th><th background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>代码文件</p></th><th background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>结果</p></th><th background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>模块 owner</p></th><th background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>备注</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>{{GPIO_PIN_1}}</p></td><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>{{GPIO_BASE_1}}</p></td><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>{{GPIO_NEW_1}}</p></td><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>{{GPIO_FILE_1}}</p></td><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>{{GPIO_RESULT_1}}</p></td><td background-color="rgb(255,200,140)" vertical-align="top"><p>待填</p></td><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>{{GPIO_NOTE_1}}</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h2 seq="auto" seq-marker="4.3">风险与未做项</h2><table><colgroup><col width="98"/><col width="162"/></colgroup><thead><tr><th background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>#</p></th><th background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>说明</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>1</p></td><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>{{RISK_1}}</p></td></tr><tr><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>2</p></td><td background-color="rgb(254,255,240)" vertical-align="top"><p>{{RISK_2}}</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p>无风险时两行均填「无」。</p><h1 seq="auto" seq-marker="5.">Bringup 过程日报</h1><table><colgroup><col width="120"/><col width="157"/><col width="157"/><col width="157"/><col width="120"/></colgroup><thead><tr><th background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>时间</p></th><th background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>今天完成任务</p></th><th background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>明天计划任务</p></th><th background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>风险或者求助</p></th><th background-color="rgba(245,246,247,0.9)" vertical-align="top"><p>备注</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td background-color="rgb(255,200,140)" vertical-align="top"><p>待填</p></td><td background-color="rgb(255,200,140)" vertical-align="top"><p></p></td><td background-color="rgb(255,200,140)" vertical-align="top"><p></p></td><td background-color="rgb(255,200,140)" vertical-align="top"><p></p></td><td background-color="rgb(255,200,140)" vertical-align="top"><p></p></td></tr></tbody></table><h1 seq="auto" seq-marker="6.">检查</h1><p>确认第 4 节变更已映射到第 3 节的代码 / 分支 / defconfig / board。勾选由人工完成。</p><ul><li><checkbox done="false">第 3 节 products、defconfig、Config.in、板型宏与仓库一致</checkbox></li><li><checkbox done="false">第 4 节器件落地表：需改项已改码或已标未完成；仅检查/否已标明</checkbox></li><li><checkbox done="false">第 4 节 GPIO：已改或已标仅清单/待定</checkbox></li><li><checkbox done="false">第 2 节原理图、硬件环境、软件计划已补或已标暂缓</checkbox></li><li><checkbox done="false">浅黄格已无 <code>{{…}}</code> 占位符；橙色格已填或明确「暂缓」</checkbox></li></ul><p></p>